# Illustration vs Implementation Separation

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-illustration-vs-implementation.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-illustration-vs-implementation.md)

## Critical

Architecture examples / scenarios / caregiver stories = **illustrations only**.  
Never convert into code branches, DB fields, UI defaults, or fixed scenarios.

## Interpret

*"Mom tried leaving the house"* → Care Recipient · Observation · Baseline change · Possible safety · Unknown cause · Relationships  

**Structure, not the sentence.**

## Never

Hardcoded Mom/Brother product paths · example-specific workflows · `mom_confusion_event` schema · sample stories as production defaults · fake timelines

## Always

Universal objects: Care Recipient → Observation → Change → Related Event → Decision → Outcome → Unknown  

Works for any person, family, condition, situation.

## Gate

> Intelligence behind the example — or the example itself?  
> If the second → do not build.

